": "2026-10-09T05:25:25.906468+00:00", "language": ""}, {"id": "1719", "title": "Bauchi NDC guber candidate resigns from party", "url": "https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/breaking-ndc-guber-candidate-dumps-party/", "final_url": "https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/breaking-ndc-guber-candidate-dumps-party/", "text": "[Politics](https://dailypost.ng/politics/)Bauchi NDC guber candidate resigns from partyPublished on October 19, 2026By [Vanessa Onah](https://dailypost.ng/author/vanessa-onah/)[Comment](https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/breaking-ndc-guber-candidate-dumps-party/comments/)Ibrahim Muhammad Kashim, the Nigeria Democratic Congress, NDC, governorship candidate in Bauchi State for the 2027 general elections, has resigned from the party.He announced his resignation in a letter dated October 16, 2026, and addressed to the NDC chairman in Bauchi Local Government Area.\u201cI hereby formally tender my resignation from the Nigeria Democratic Congress (NDC), effective from the date of this letter.\u201cThis decision has been taken after careful consideration and is a matter of personal choice. I wish to express my appreciation to the party leadership and members for the opportunity to have been associated with the NDC.Recommended[BREAKING: Cristiano Ronaldo suspended by Portugal for 30 days, fined \u20ac255](https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/breaking-cristiano-ronaldo-suspended-by-portugal-for-30-days-fined-255/)[2027: 'Tinubu doing politics, wickedness since becoming president' - Atiku's aide replies Alake](https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/2027-tinubu-doing-politics-wickedness-since-becoming-president-atikus-aide-replies-alake/)[2027: Only POS business this govt has given you - ADC urges Nigerians to reject APC](https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/2027-only-pos-business-this-govt-has-given-you-adc-urges-nigerians-to-reject-apc/)\u201cI respectfully request that my resignation be acknowledged and that the necessary records be updated accordingly. Please accept the assurances of my highest regards,\u201d the statement read.Share this story[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/?text=Bauchi%20NDC%20guber%20candidate%20resigns%20from%20party%20https%3A%2F%2Fdailypost.ng%2F2026%2F10%2F19%2Fbreaking-ndc-guber-candidate-dumps-party%2F) FacebookYou may like[2027: Tinubu's campaigner, Showunmi defends wife's new INEC role](https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/inec-appointment-tinubus-campaigner-showunmi-opens-up-on-wifes-new-role/)[Ex-Minority Whip seeks to overturn judgment nullifying Gombe APC Primary](https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/jc-appeals-court-ruling-nullifying-gombe-re-election-ticket/)['DSS DG a coward, Joe Igbokwe lost his mind long ago' - Sowore](https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/dss-dg-coward-joe-igbokwe-lost-his-mind-long-ago-sowore/)[Join the conversation](https://dailypost.ng/2026/10/19/breaking-ndc-guber-candidate-dumps-party/comments/)", "content_hash": "1ff4b897ec0370ac9b3aafd5dc1ca05bed7be3af7971fc35ca46e8ba2a279702", "domain": "dailypost.ng", "fetched_at": "2026-10-09T05:25:26.966792+00:00", "language": ""}, {"id": "1720", "title": "SUO MOTU", "url": "https://nigerianlawguru.com/caselaw_digest/suo-motu/", "final_url": "https://nigerianlawguru.com/caselaw_digest/suo-motu/", "text": "SUO MOTU Skip to content email: info@nigerianlawguru.cominfo@nigerianlawguru.com Phone: +2347066957900+2347066957900 Contact Us: Benin City, Nigeria Open Menu Home Our Team Articles Arbitration Commercial Law Company Law Constitutional Law Criminal Law and Procedure Customary Law and Procedure Family Law Environmental Law General Human Rights Law Insurance Intellectual Property Law International Law Jurisprudence Labour Law Maritime Law Oil and Gas Practice and Procedure Revenue Law Torts HOW TO TENDER AND PLAY VIDEO EVIDENCE IN COURT Caselaw Digest Legislations Constitutions of Nations Laws of the Federation of Nigeria Oil and Gas Legislations Rules Statutes Judgments Chieftaincy Matters Commercial Law Constitutional Law Criminal Law Customary Law Election Cases Environm